Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.98,JP,,0,0,0,,分かった。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.98,VI,,0,0,0,,Dạ hiểu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:03.38,JP,,0,0,0,,この中の一つを選んでくれるかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.98,0:00:03.38,VI,,0,0,0,,Cháu chọn một quả trong này nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:05.66,JP,,0,0,0,,私は後ろを向いてるから。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.04,0:00:05.66,VI,,0,0,0,,Ta sẽ quay lưng lại.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:06.70,JP,,0,0,0,,分かった。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.66,0:00:06.70,VI,,0,0,0,,Dạ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.86,JP,,0,0,0,,一つ選んだかい？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.86,VI,,0,0,0,,Chọn xong chưa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.72,JP,,0,0,0,,選んだ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.72,VI,,0,0,0,,Chọn rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:14.42,JP,,0,0,0,,君が選んだのは黄色だ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.66,0:00:14.42,VI,,0,0,0,,Cái cháu chọn là màu vàng.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.40,JP,,0,0,0,,違う。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.40,VI,,0,0,0,,Sai rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:18.98,JP,,0,0,0,,青！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.72,0:00:18.98,VI,,0,0,0,,Xanh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:19.70,JP,,0,0,0,,違う。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.98,0:00:19.70,VI,,0,0,0,,Sai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:22.48,JP,,0,0,0,,赤！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.14,0:00:22.48,VI,,0,0,0,,Đỏ!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.56,JP,,0,0,0,,当たり！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.56,VI,,0,0,0,,Đúng rồi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:24.70,JP,,0,0,0,,そう、赤よ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.76,0:00:24.70,VI,,0,0,0,,Đúng, màu đỏ đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:25.72,JP,,0,0,0,,すごい！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.32,0:00:25.72,VI,,0,0,0,,Giỏi quá!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.74,JP,,0,0,0,,このマジック、ダメね。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.74,VI,,0,0,0,,Trò ảo thuật này dở ghê.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:31.98,JP,,0,0,0,,だって全部の色言ったでしょ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.74,0:00:31.98,VI,,0,0,0,,Vì bố nói hết tất cả các màu rồi còn gì.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.58,JP,,0,0,0,,ペッパ、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.58,VI,,0,0,0,,Peppa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:34.76,JP,,0,0,0,,誰にも言うなよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.58,0:00:34.76,VI,,0,0,0,,đừng nói với ai nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:39.46,JP,,0,0,0,,もっとマジックを見たいかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.48,0:00:39.46,VI,,0,0,0,,Mọi người có muốn xem thêm ảo thuật không nào?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.54,JP,,0,0,0,,目を閉じて。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.54,VI,,0,0,0,,Nhắm mắt lại nào.
